# status: hypothesized — regression lock, not box-verified
# PMT, program 1, PCR PID 0x101, ES 0x02 (video) @0x101 and 0x81 @0x102,
# no CA descriptors. Section only (#17).
# Hand cross-check against ISO/IEC 13818-1 §2.4.4.8 (#18, F6-15):
#   02        table_id 0x02 (TS_program_map_section)
#   b0 17     section_syntax_indicator 1, '0', reserved 11, section_length 23
#             = prog# 2 + ver/cn 1 + sec#/last# 2 + PCR_PID 2 + prog_info_len 2
#               + two ES loops of 5 + CRC 4
#   00 01     program_number 1
#   c1        version 0, current_next 1
#   00 00     section_number 0, last_section_number 0
#   e1 01     reserved 111, PCR_PID 0x101
#   f0 00     reserved 1111, program_info_length 0
#   02 e1 01 f0 00   stream_type 0x02, elementary_PID 0x101, ES_info_length 0
#   81 e1 02 f0 00   stream_type 0x81, elementary_PID 0x102, ES_info_length 0
#   d8 a8 b5 b5  CRC_32, recomputed with the same independent bitwise CRC; the
#             whole section checks to 0.
02 b0 17 00 01 c1 00 00 e1 01 f0 00 02 e1 01 f0
00 81 e1 02 f0 00 d8 a8 b5 b5
